{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:59832defa858aa416403c556a26abf9e8b420f6685e32e699221b7417a2309c8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d1770077de7e819c5f462fd455a762a0621242cca300b2c1f0fa56c5f9fda25",
      "text": "“喜欢”的心情",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb451367f144e70e0d483b248ecc23fe4041710d93991d96a6fc5b22bfb92f51",
      "text": "听说某位知名导演正在举行试镜，\n锐心便向制作人提出了申请。\n作为试镜对策，\n两人决定在他家一起观看电影。\n锐心喜欢电影的缘由究竟是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d1770077de7e819c5f462fd455a762a0621242cca300b2c1f0fa56c5f9fda25",
      "text": "“喜欢”的心情",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa910e0a5097befddabccc6b97520cd9e665f78fdb1b94a826280b602e5bd79b",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，方便吗。\n我有话跟你说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:053542e4a716a46fe1a445ac93cf76d45d4ed4748ff91b2db3a699aad9094854",
      "text": "好的，有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66252c27a21e0f79fff610f90c9232b28a189ba0f2a49c3f354068eca52f00bf",
      "text": "我想参加这部电影的试镜。\n方便安排吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d796d88022312615ec276f396d7012ba7c361cd8862cf72fbff947a307cec2b",
      "text": "（这是……知名导演的最新力作啊。\n这次的内容看起来也同样备受瞩目呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49cb08d4cf964d6190ea86543f75e7e4c5c3dc5f8aa592ba557cf243be408f0b",
      "text": "我这就去确认日程。\n试镜的相关资料我也会去调取准备好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6589329ae2ec43e90312503cd0d094f69692b9335a3ae5dd1ed10412ba7d7764",
      "text": "嗯。……虽说是出于个人原因，\n但这次的试镜……我无论如何都想参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:196ae877dd5c563eb4cef061029eea23cf8eb92ce025dfd4737ba96a5a25b6fb",
      "text": "通过身为演员的双亲，\n我和这位导演见过几次面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ca446711744cadd75145406e690c485aade18d017a87a9d5ffe392ab812657",
      "text": "那个时候，我同他约定过，如果我进了演艺圈，\n就会去参加他执导电影的试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc4a1f59ae1ef0d495a22db3e9a42f6fe48a21997af77703ef07a4bea9ca525a",
      "text": "这次，我想履行那个约定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c38c32e4d4222728933afcfd5c996476d1d9e7685156034d07b563ab409fbf04",
      "text": "锐心先生，对这位导演\n很熟悉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f69baaf6a0d4d60e5165aa146b1d0192709174d25e01035467035e551c0b6579",
      "text": "倒也算不上“很熟悉”……不过确实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:caba443e5bac001c21c485dce3731052a88bb97ab320c871afd3fe09fb71547b",
      "text": "在坊间一般都被说成是一个\n除了创作作品外一概不关心的怪人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:291d15eaa9cf088007d3f2aa4a3909dad19f5252f055759f48a34f5a9811f2a7",
      "text": "据说如果演员的演技不能令他满意，\n在现场也会毫不留情地狠狠贬低。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6672f17a5e58c4918f23fd1947628f531dcec2929e0fa14009cdb9b5f6c5a74",
      "text": "虽然他好像还挺看好我父母的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f8363101a12f9d7c4d60469f78b1ef3b476027ab053aa891a039c74ec67b53",
      "text": "总之，就是喜恶分明。\n而且会堂堂正正地表现出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c72a1d12bcb75b1e7cf6678466e17c446e12fcdf4f03f509238f2aa0dadab6dd",
      "text": "看来是个作风相当激烈的人呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4a4d5823622dd40fe0e1c39edb544b4a0e7bc7986881038ee803285f98f9af6",
      "text": "是啊。作为人际交往的对象，我也并不擅长应付这类人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef579f953c6ff5eb7d1bc1ec5d6391b5f41146b29ffa6adbedfd647a6465d81d",
      "text": "但对他的作品则是另一回事了。\n虽然确实有很多讽刺意味的表现手法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc75b385e615c665256b5702b79746d0ecebc9ce61fa232db09c926b2cc4031",
      "text": "……不，让你带有太多先入为主的观念也不好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5a7787e55f45d971d845c307fbcd11e2e61838ea83b99f186afb1cb0e41b911",
      "text": "制作人，周末要是不介意的话要不要来我家？\n一起去看看他的名作电影……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09d3fca76a589c71e08b453944b6664e65020279081f090dece11595357a9a65",
      "text": "……也是为了制定试镜对策，\n提前看上几部会比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2763d51e9e96478d0d5668bae5a2dc7adf876eee6e75f91ccfd6b9c3417745be",
      "text": "今天特意把家里的影音室借给我，\n真是太感谢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40ce97debae6d50efcbe93c8fbe944c2e5e2ef9f19a82644ef198bf39fc37e9c",
      "text": "不必客气。本来\n也就是为了我的试镜才看的电影。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f7a47f8b2e4939b64aa480d7517d4a82b897fcc6b2e7470df39e2165770b088",
      "text": "随意放松就好。\n那边的饮料和水果，也可以随便享用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4f8abe459463751ce7b1194a90219666c9723f31fda47620470124fceb34912",
      "text": "（锐心先生，总觉得有点雀跃呢……\n简直就像在脸上写着“享受的准备已万全！”一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a0b48d26b120e9c17bbea9bc7730d232038a4270dca147ed4101f72920e9693",
      "text": "喂，苹果你是削皮吃？\n还是连皮一起吃？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ed60c488029497a8691e88dd91c1f87526fb784888d5f22a2ae1428c517801c",
      "text": "诶。哪、哪种都可以！\n谢谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8d3ea734369c0e6cf3a9dcd841573260ac86a850deedf47fd257f4b9e83f7fa",
      "text": "话说回来，\n真是个非常气派的影音室呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b30a704ef3c56ed6b7604fee13a16b6e77280111350bd8e9ca0621d92497a6d1",
      "text": "嗯。是因为父母工作性质的关系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36e9d3e4a1dc59d2caa9a29a59d8b9bcadb32c27a652fc5907c1bbf882493a56",
      "text": "话虽如此，因为他们两人很忙，\n用得最多的恐怕是我吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44c1eb2b0b46e3e64434075caff96adf442a6f94689556332b672d8684960cb7",
      "text": "我虽然知道锐心先生喜欢电影，\n但你具体是喜欢电影的哪一点呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3b804a316d0aa691cdf35c8e00ca3749a059b5c68ac188ff90aca5c59a93ee8",
      "text": "……喜欢它能让人化身为不同于自己的另一个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b300acadea902bbc05a223526a3c288a5e287ae6328af26674eb6482aaeac5e8",
      "text": "只要化身为电影里的登场人物，\n当下的环境和问题全都会被抛诸脑后。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ec57a8acd56fa3d4415a73b9d7dbe5f3e91eb47270e3624624622f5a88d1f44",
      "text": "就连父母，在电影中也会变成素不相识的陌生人。\n创作的世界就是这么有趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64ad721d23ddd5188911214590f3059eb83b101b4e984a63c14da8dc1ce9883b",
      "text": "……好，准备好了。开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000036:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e09ee6b3131593648d01e2f9c214a8ea227a78cbd2e57727a3773766ee32d39",
      "text": "……已经到片尾演职员表了吗。\n真是一眨眼的工夫啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:688bf831a23a35a8040af245af61b3e5a8b1fec2ea70ad9aac08c4239b9e0a0e",
      "text": "临近尾声时，你好几次都探出身子看呢。\n是很喜欢的场景吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55cf08c7d785ef751704740a79448ddec1584ccb68fc6edfe37e6a6c3d7bb2f6",
      "text": "……嗯。就是那个长镜头的场景。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d64d6096d0cee35a11b4e7db1091cae9c69e240d30fc390685367af906c0aa6",
      "text": "明明是一段漫长且舒缓的对话，\n看着却不会觉得很有紧张感吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:088e6b1e1a8758e1791bc2eb6b0191d3fbe86b8635684a325ac51f100bd6e302",
      "text": "画面节奏与观众接收到的感觉\n截然相反，这点非常有趣。也是这位导演的特征。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7d49f608fd36cabed35b2a6bd814bd71ecf6b15d8324aa06b7efbf4448b3dd1",
      "text": "看来你真的是他的忠实粉丝呢。难道说，\n你想参加试镜的真正理由其实是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11894f068f6eca47581a95e32f45108e92973e4e296160192ca7a8218b1c2ec6",
      "text": "……抱歉。过去的约定虽然也是真的……\n……但这种动机，未免太不纯粹了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3217e563133326498e384147860c27e2720d7378dd44f4af3e906e8b2cc09103",
      "text": "没那回事！用喜欢的工作来激发干劲，\n我觉得也绝不是什么坏事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c985d4b9b3ff7badafcb6b817e46f5afab7953c075b6f7406d23f3077fc37d7",
      "text": "……不，但是……我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47294ddf7d91f2bc8e3a22845cc7afb3e1cc4a2bb33f9efa1e2375d86a03f6ed",
      "text": "而且，看到锐心先生享受工作的样子，\n粉丝们也会露出笑容的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:063a85459cbee5521bfbfaa9034176defd37a332e865012e6a758370b62b3c96",
      "text": "……也是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:697ec9646406c17887bcd883a824168f219ef8f5c3f1163ecdbfba5d75d8ed5e",
      "text": "陪我花了这么长时间。我送你一段路吧。\n别落下东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000052:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c45255d4c4c85003d40e98acaf529841cf0c4bcca3d12f2b66549f0c32f25e2",
      "text": "锐心先生！恭喜你。\n试镜通过了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e419677a7a3af6411207a5c4cc5cc6bcb3d8e22aa860e38ffc76db418042183",
      "text": "嗯。为了不玷污导演的作品，\n也是为了粉丝，我会倾尽全力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65ea75e2e0131989d236de563051085f0a1d5b26294418722cbe2885b8e728b4",
      "text": "作为制作人，为了工作本身，\n如果锐心先生自己也能乐在其中，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e41893baa8e4b95474bd02e1b15271a1b1c8007dc0e8c1152ea886cf77069e3d",
      "text": "……真固执啊。……不过我也没资格说别人就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50b1acb6c743869d82446485c3d7bf87ebf71be18bf72e8614e94e2511c916df",
      "text": "我明白了。既然你说有这个必要的话……\n为了让我自己也能享受其中，我会试着努力一下的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
